0,Kandawo language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kandawo_language,"Kandawo, also known as Narake (but see related Narak) is a Trans-New Guinea language of Western Highlands Province, Papua New Guinea. A dialect survey of Kandawo has been conducted by Graham (1998).",Kandawo,Trans-New Guinea
